            "notes": "**ROUND 3:**\n\n*Showtime.*\n\n[Packstacker](item_87b99cde-3089-42fd-86bc-6e1ebf3fe422) + [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) turns you into 5 lucios at once. The AOE healing output is insane. It's about 250/s in practice range on your whole team in a perfect scenario.\n\nGrab both [Repair Pack](ability_dcad0648-f36b-44cf-9d5e-22af3744e6e4) related [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) items ([Mitzi's Medicine](item_382d3dbd-63b8-453f-9be3-fefc3600dd24) and [Haste Paste](item_79a3c2ab-1cad-453a-b5ac-55bdad40cfe7)).\n\nThe idea is that you spread [Repair Pack](ability_dcad0648-f36b-44cf-9d5e-22af3744e6e4) onto your team, then charge in with [Shield Bash](ability_5f74ef54-49ff-4e8a-8422-69d99ad13c44), [Whip Shot](ability_b11d31d7-cf58-4e0d-8ec8-fbde3af5bb04), then [Whirlwhip](item_35a738cd-73d3-4d6c-86e4-76df3eeb7df6) for SEVEN, maybe even EIGHT (versus [Kiriko](hero_70a0ac5c-2a55-4fab-beeb-2f570886426f) [Clone Conjuration](item_6c9f6be1-ab29-4f46-af24-34e4835f9af3)) procs which extend the duration so long that your cooldowns are up before it ends.",
