            "notes": "**ROUND 5**\n\nNow we need to tank up. \n\n[Biolight Overflow](item_1220eaec-f913-4de2-816c-0dc070b285d0) is the unsung hero of this build because you can cleanse [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54) burn with it. Even if they don't have an [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54), you can cleanse [Charge](ability_15fea890-a958-4263-9fee-c7c13d909ba7), [Earthshatter](ability_f8f0fa28-b544-4a28-b074-146e7087fc3a), and your own tank's [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8).\n\nedit: [Junker Whatchamajig](item_b81ebab8-5c85-405a-b28d-2496de33cd9c) is leaving the build. We hate to see him go, but we love to watch him leave. We'll be taking [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1) in his stead. This will give you unparalleled survivability for the price. It's similar to [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) for half the price.",
